From 12f48a617b97cdb386cfd822c5e243e1de641370 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Sangalli <eddyrodrigues@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:01:28 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(srt): add verified 4:4:4 and synchronized packed
 alpha output

Encode an independent I444 view through x264 and MPEG-TS/SRT. Pack straight Fill and grayscale Key into one frame, retain destination configuration, and guard unsupported codec/protocol combinations. Rebind the shader texture between techniques.

Verified loopback reception: High 4:4:4 Predictive, full range, 640x180 at 30 fps; reconstructed alpha MAE 0 and RGB MAE 0.202 over a ten-second test. Normal isolated shutdown, exit zero and no crash. Internet/Full HD capacity and receiver interoperability remain separate validation.
